rule reach v1
description "A table over a derived value whose last row lies past what the derive reaches: the check calls the row unreachable (E102), from the same reach a question over ranges of the inputs reads"

enum band = small | big | huge

inputs
  amount : money[GBP]  range >=1GBP <=100GBP
  limit  : money[GBP]  range >=0GBP <=100GBP

outputs
  out : band

derive excess : money[GBP] = amount - limit  range >=-1000GBP <=1000GBP

table t
policy unique
| excess          | -> out : band |
| <=0GBP          | small         |
| >0GBP <=500GBP  | big           |
| >500GBP         | huge          |

examples
| amount | limit | -> out |
| 1GBP   | 100GBP | small |
| 100GBP | 0GBP   | big   |
